cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this MCP server, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: Forest Compliance MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server for EU Deforestation Regulation (EUDR) screening of farm plots. It
  checks whether the land was forest on 31 December 2020 (JRC Global Forest
  Cover 2020) and whether that forest was lost since (Hansen Global Forest
  Change), draws plot and overview maps, and joins EUDR and drought risk into a
  supply-chain resilience matrix.
